      "description": "This painting beautifully portrays Lord Krishna in his youthful form, radiating divine charm, innocence, and serenity. Every element of the artwork has been thoughtfully composed to reflect his connection with nature, beauty, devotion, and music.\r\n\r\nAt the top, Krishna is adorned with an elaborate mukut (crown), richly decorated with golden ornaments and red gemstone details. The crown is surrounded by vibrant peacock feathers, one of the most iconic symbols associated with Krishna, representing beauty, grace, and divine playfulness. Nestled within the mukut are blooming pink lotuses, adding a sense of purity, love, and spiritual beauty.\r\n\r\nHis dark, flowing hair frames his gentle face, while a soft decorative cloth wraps gracefully around his head. His expressive eyes, delicately shaped eyebrows, and calm gaze capture the youthful innocence and enchanting charm of Krishna. The subtle smile on his lips adds warmth and a sense of divine peace.\r\n\r\nHe wears elegant golden earrings adorned with red stones, complementing the richness of his crown. A radiant yellow garment, reminiscent of Krishna's traditional Pitambar, forms a vibrant backdrop around him and brings warmth to the composition.\r\n\r\nIn his hands rests the golden bansuri (flute), decorated with delicate floral details. The flute symbolizes Krishna's divine music—believed to captivate not only people but all of nature. The flowers surrounding it further enhance the connection between Krishna, music, and the natural world.\r\n\r\nFinally, adorning his neck is a beautiful floral mala (garland) made of soft yellow blossoms. The mala adds a touch of devotion and purity, completing his divine appearance.\r\n\r\nTogether, the mukut, peacock feathers, lotuses, jewellery, flute, Pitambar, and floral mala create a harmonious portrayal of young Krishna—playful yet serene, youthful yet divine, and forever surrounded by the beauty of nature and devotion.",
      "id": "art-mtlg8j3k-fqk2",
      "medium": "Acrylic on Canvas",
      "category": "Canvas Paintings",
      "isFeatured": false,
      "title": "KRISHNA IN YOUTH AGE",
      "publicId": "akanksha-art-studio/x8gujotjgwyntodriqj8",
